      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prinsburg%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Prinsburg sits in a humid continental climate, with long cold winters and short warm summers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
